<title>USA: MoneyGram now at 800 U.K. post offices.</title>
<headline>MoneyGram now at 800 U.K. post offices.</headline>
<dateline>LAKEWOOD, Colo. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>MoneyGram Payment Systems Inc said Friday its money transfer services was now available in 800 locations of the United Kingdom Post Office.</p>
<p>An additional 700 locations will be operating within 30 days as part of a contract with Post Office Counters Ltd, which operates nearly 19,000 postal counters for the UK postal service, it said.</p>
<p>Under a five year contract, MoneyGram said it may add as many locations as required to meet demand for its services.</p>
<p>MoneyGram operates through a worldwide network of more than 18,500 agents in 85 countries.</p>
</text>
